(ACME GADGETS - ACCOUNT FAQ \(SAMPLE DATA\)) '
() '
(How do I reset my password?) '
(Open the sign-in page and select 'Forgot password'. Enter the email address on your) '
(account. We send a reset link that stays valid for 30 minutes. If no email arrives, check) '
(the spam folder and confirm that the address is spelled correctly.) '
() '
(Why is my account locked?) '
(After five failed sign-in attempts the account is locked for 15 minutes. Waiting is) '
(usually enough; agents can also unlock it after verifying the customer's name and order) '
(number.) '
ET
endstream
