(How do I change my email address?) '
(Go to Settings, then Profile, and choose Change email. A confirmation code is sent to the) '
(new address. The old address keeps working until the code is confirmed.) '
() '
(How do I enable two-step verification?) '
(Open Settings, then Security, and turn on two-step verification. Scan the QR code with an) '
(authenticator app and enter the six-digit code to finish setup.) '
ET
endstream
